    the level\u2019s verified run history. voltage \u2265 4.8 V. voltage \u2264 5.2
    V.\nGeneral teaching principle: A feedback controller compares measured behavior
    with a reference and acts subject to plant dynamics and limits.\nOnly fresh,
    authoritative game evidence can establish that this objective is complete."
